{
  "about": [
    "Real data from Base Sepolia (chain 84532), read through https://sepolia.base.org on 2026-10-14 with read-only calls, for every transaction of the payout split experiment of 2026-10-09 (the same eighteen, in the same order, as apps/gateway/src/split/base-sepolia-experiment.json).",
    "For each transaction: its receipt's status, the USDC Transfer logs it emitted (from, to, value) and the amount of each SplitDistributed it emitted; and the parties' balances at the block before it and at its own block, read with eth_call: the USDC each holds (held) and the USDC the 0xSplits warehouse credits each (credited, warehouse balanceOf(owner, uint256(USDC))).",
    "The parties are named in parties; warehouse in a transfer is the 0xSplits warehouse 0x8fb66F38cF86A3d5e8768f8F1754A24A6c661Fb8. No experiment transaction shared a block with another, so each pair of reads brackets one transaction."
  ],
